      "message": "Gemini feedback:\n\n----\n\nIn `ParseAltSetting`, you loop over all endpoints to find the Bulk IN and Bulk OUT addresses:\n\n```c\nfor (const auto\u0026 ep : std::span(alt.endpoint, alt.bNumEndpoints)) {\n  // ... check and assign info.ep_bulk_in / ep_bulk_out ...\n}\n\nif (info.ep_bulk_in !\u003d 0 \u0026\u0026 info.ep_bulk_out !\u003d 0) {\n  return info;\n}\n\n```\n\n**Improvement:** You can move that `if` check *inside* the loop. Once you\u0027ve found both endpoints, there is no need to keep iterating through remaining endpoints for that interface setting.\n\n```c\nfor (const auto\u0026 ep : std::span(alt.endpoint, alt.bNumEndpoints)) {\n  // ... assignment logic ...\n  \n  if (info.ep_bulk_in !\u003d 0 \u0026\u0026 info.ep_bulk_out !\u003d 0) {\n    return info; // Exit early the moment we have both\n  }\n}\nreturn std::nullopt;\n\n```",
